AB  - This paper presents an retrieval-augmented based question-answering model tailored for power grid dispatch regulations. We introduce an automated high-quality fune-tuning dataset generation approach based on the parsed power grid dispatch regulations clauses for question-answering model. Additionally, a robust retrieval-augmented generation finetuning method using Low-Rank Adaptation is employed to strengthen the model's resilience against irrelevant information. Experimental results demonstrate the effectiveness of the proposed method, the model achieves improvements in accuracy compared to baseline models. This method, by integrating automated dataset generation, retrieval-augmented generation, and robust fine-tuning, offers a reliable and efficient solution for question-answering tasks in the power grid dispatch domain.
